# Personal Project Notes

This file is intentionally local. Copy it to `CLAUDE.local.md` and add that name
to `.gitignore`.

Use it for machine-specific facts that would be wrong for anyone else:

- Preferred editor / local tooling paths
- Reference hardware or test accounts available on this machine
- Local environment quirks worth remembering across sessions
- Temporary experiment notes

Never store certificates, passwords, tokens, API keys, or provisioning profiles
here. `.claude/settings.json` denies reads of common secret paths, but this file
is not one of them — it is loaded into context in full.
